py:207)\n```","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1449829981,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2MzkwNDUzOQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/316#issuecomment-163904539"},"message":"Okay, first of all, we need to clarify, what exactly we want uninstall-handle to do. See also #250 .\nSecondly, what I see in your posts, is the handle not being removed from the bogus-100 collection - you look into this one instead of master-collection.\nThis nevertheless might be considered a bug, but I'm not so sure about it. Why would uninstall-handle modify a collection other than the master-collection?\nWas the actual handle repository removed? What does master-collection look like? It doesn't find a bogus261-1000 anymore, so this looks good to me.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1449842428,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2Mzk0MjQ3OA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/316#issuecomment-163942478"},"message":"ha -- I could swear that it did remove the actual handle but I guess I was wrong... \n\n```\nhopa:/tmp/collection-1000\n$\u003e ls -ld bogus381-1000  \ndrwx------ 4 yoh yoh 100 Dec 10 14:38 bogus381-1000/\n\n$\u003e DATALAD_COLLECTION_PATH=$PWD/master-collection datalad uninstall-handle bogus381-1000             \n\n$\u003e ls -ld bogus381-1000                                                                 \ndrwx------ 4 yoh yoh 100 Dec 10 14:38 bogus381-1000/\n\n$\u003e DATALAD_COLLECTION_PATH=$PWD/master-collection datalad list-handles | grep bogus381-1000\nDATALAD_COLLECTION_PATH=$PWD/master-collection datalad list-handles  27.85s user 0.56s system 98% cpu 28.769 total\ngrep --color=auto -d skip bogus381-1000  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 28.769 total\n```\n\nso indeed handle remained physically present, so this action resulted in \"unregistering\" that handle within local master collection (note that it took 28sec to list handles!) and not within its original collection:\n\n```\n$\u003e grep bogus381-1000 master-collection/datalad.ttl \n\n$\u003e grep bogus381-1000 bogus-1000_collection/datalad.ttl \n        \u003cfile:///home/yoh/proj/datalad/datalad-master/docs/examples/collection-1000/bogus381-1000\u003e,\n```\n\nI feel that in terms of API names, we should uniformize 'register' with 'add' and 'unregister' with 'remove', and `uninstall-handle` in current implementation of it is more of 'unregister'.    What command currently allows to remove/unregister handle from a given (not master) collection?\n\nP.S. To me this is yet another example of having 'master collection' as the beast which tracks all of the handles, instead of following filesystem hierarchy as git/etc do, introduces unnecessary level of complication","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1449843059,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2Mzk0NDY4OA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/316#issuecomment-163944688"},"message":"Actually, the current implementation should remove the handle repo. So, could you look the handle up before uninstall? (using datalad whereis) May be your custom master collection is talking about another location, than you do?","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1449844608,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2Mzk1MDYxMQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/316#issuecomment-163950611"},"message":"ah -- right.  I forgot that all those locations are with absolute paths (thank you RDF! bleh... although may be it is not the RDF to blame ... ;) )!!!  and it did remove it... bleh\n\nand now I see that in original report I was checking that directory not under master but under original collection, so report is invalid, closing it\n\nHaving said that, such actions as removing handle, unregistering within collection should have had log messages at the level of info at least, now nothing gets spit out","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1449844608,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50NDg5Mzk2NDc4"},"status":2}]}